{"name":"KKL.fourierCoeff_lowDegreePart","v":1,"source_hash":"4f51c3774a0bcafd","lines":["n : ℕ","f : BooleanFunc n","k : ℕ","S : Finset (Fin n)","⊢ BooleanAnalysis.fourierCoeff (lowDegreePart f k) S = if S.card ≤ k then BooleanAnalysis.fourierCoeff f S else 0","⊢ BooleanAnalysis.fourierCoeff (fun x => ∑ S, if S.card ≤ k then BooleanAnalysis.fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x else 0) S =","    if S.card ≤ k then BooleanAnalysis.fourierCoeff f S else 0","⊢ uniformWeight n *","      ∑ x,","        (fun x =>","            (fun x => ∑ S, if S.card ≤ k then (uniformWeight n * ∑ x, (fun x => f x * chiS S x) x) * chiS S x else 0)","                x *","              chiS S x)","          x =","    if S.card ≤ k then uniformWeight n * ∑ x, (fun x => f x * chiS S x) x else 0","      ∑ x, (∑ S, if S.card ≤ k then (uniformWeight n * ∑ x, f x * chiS S x) * chiS S x else 0) * chiS S x =","    if S.card ≤ k then uniformWeight n * ∑ x, f x * chiS S x else 0","w : ℝ := uniformWeight n","⊢ w * ∑ x, (∑ S, if S.card ≤ k then (w * ∑ x, f x * chiS S x) * chiS S x else 0) * chiS S x =","    if S.card ≤ k then w * ∑ x, f x * chiS S x else 0","fhat : Finset (Fin n) → ℝ := fun T => w * ∑ y, f y * chiS T y","step1 :","  w * ∑ x, (∑ T, if T.card ≤ k then fhat T * chiS T x else 0) * chiS S x =","    ∑ T, if T.card ≤ k then fhat T * (w * ∑ x, chiS T x * chiS S x) else 0","⊢ w * ∑ x, (∑ T, if T.card ≤ k then fhat T * chiS T x else 0) * chiS S x =","⊢ ∑ i, w * ((∑ T, if T.card ≤ k then fhat T * chiS T i else 0) * chiS S i) =","⊢ ∑ x, w * ∑ i, (if i.card ≤ k then fhat i * chiS i x else 0) * chiS S x =","| ∑ i, w * ((∑ T, if T.card ≤ k then fhat T * chiS T i else 0) * chiS S i)","x : BoolCube n","| w * ∑ i, (if i.card ≤ k then fhat i * chiS i x else 0) * chiS S x","| fun i => w * ((∑ T, if T.card ≤ k then fhat T * chiS T i else 0) * chiS S i)","| w * ((∑ T, if T.card ≤ k then fhat T * chiS T x else 0) * chiS S x)","⊢ (∑ x, w * ∑ x_1, if x_1.card ≤ k then fhat x_1 * (chiS x_1 x * chiS S x) else 0) =","⊢ ∀